{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14691","headline":"桂阳北岭偶过野人所居聊书即事呈王永州邕李道州圻 · 戴叔伦","name":"桂阳北岭偶过野人所居聊书即事呈王永州邕李道州圻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"犬吠空山响，林深一迳存。\n隔云寻板屋，渡水到柴门。\n日昼风烟静，花明草树繁。\n乍疑秦世客，渐识楚人言。\n不记逃乡里，居然长子孙。\n种田烧险谷，汲井凿高原。\n畦叶藏春雉，庭柯宿旅猨。\n岭阴无瘴疠，地隙有兰荪。\n内户均皮席，枯瓢沃野餐。\n远心知自负，幽赏讵能论。\n转步重崖合，瞻途落照昏。\n他时愿携手，莫比武陵源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}